<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Dear Future Sun Devil,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Thank you for expressing interest in the <a href="https://newcollege.asu.edu/interdisciplinary-arts-and-performance-degree">Interdisciplinary Arts &amp; Performance (BA)</a> program at Arizona State University. Students engage with faculty in collaborative investigation of many disciplines, preparing for our complex and changing world through current approaches to artistic and aesthetic research. Students engage in practical and theoretical studies of visual, sonic, performance and interactive arts to become versatile artists. Students usually look to work as Arts Educators, Composers, Choreographers, Film/video editors, Graphic designers, Multimedia Installation Artists, Sound Artists, Theater Directors, Video Artists, Video Game designers, Visual Artists, and Visual Effects Animators among many others. By viewing the <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/roadmaps/ASU00/ASIAPBA/null/ALL/2016">major map</a>, you can see the degree requirements outlined for graduation.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Be sure to review our <a href="https://students.asu.edu/freshman/requirements">admission and application requirements</a> for more information about the application process in an easy to follow format. For finding more ways to pay for college, please visit our <a href="https://newcollege.asu.edu/college-scholarships">scholarships</a> page.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">It's important to find the right fit for your undergraduate program. A great way to learn more about this degree is to register for one of our upcoming information sessions. You can <a href="https://visit.asu.edu/">visit ASU</a> and register for a tour.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">We can’t wait to see you here at West campus! If you have any questions about New College, West campus, or one of our 35 programs, please contact our Recruitment Office through the information listed below. Thank you, and we’ll talk to you soon!</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Kindest Regards</b>,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">New College Recruitment Team</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">New College of Interdisciplinary Arts and Sciences</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" color="#990000">Arizona State University, West campus</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="mailto:asknewcollege@asu.edu">asknewcollege@asu.edu</a>&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">602-543-2890</font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>